WEBVTT

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:09.090
If you give up and choose the path of destruction,
you can never build anything worthwhile.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:13.630
No matter what happens, I never give up

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.640
You can never have friends or a best place

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:23.940
Or develop a technique that'll
smash your enemies to pieces!

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:00.370
You want me to train you?

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:01.740
Yeah

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.790
I want to become a Shaman too,
I'm begging you, pops

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:11.710
Can you turn Ryu of the
Wooden Sword into a man?

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:14.030
Go home

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:17.920
That wasn't nice!

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:20.680
You clobbered me
without even asking why!

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:24.600
Is this the way you ask people for favors?

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:28.640
You just want to be
popular with girls, don't you?

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:32.020
How'd you know, pops?

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:37.530
I'm sorry, but there's no
reason for me to train you.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.320
Now go

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:41.410
I'm sorry

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:45.330
But I can't involve outsiders in the
Asakura's war

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.290
Stingy!

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.870
Can't you help me just a little?!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:50.960
You're a determined guy

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:54.310
But no matter how much
you try, he's not going to budge

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.670
What?

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:57.510
Who the hell is there?

00:02:58.340 --> 00:03:00.970
It's me, I still owe you one

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:03.430
Huh?! T-Tokageroh?

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:04.970
What're you dong here?

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.560
Who knows

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.230
Even I have no idea

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:14.150
I just don't know where I belong anymore

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:19.650
Your grudge is gone?

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:24.570
Yeah, gone without a
trace, much to my surprise.

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:30.210
I wanted revenge against Amidamaru
so badly, but now I don't care.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.500
He's one odd kid

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:39.630
The moment I got involved with him,
everything I cared about suddenly dissolved.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:43.890
Do you think I'm crazy?

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.720
How could the infamous
Tokageroh have gone so soft?

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.470
Isn't that good?

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:53.100
You're okay.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.190
You're not angry, you're not sad...

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.880
You've achieved a
normal state of being

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.940
Normal state?

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:05.780
Yeah, you see, it's easy for
people to get caught up in emotions.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.910
We're all more or less alike.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:12.740
The slightest thing makes
us friends or causes us to fight.

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:18.000
But in reality, there are no
friends or enemies in this world.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:22.570
It's just all suffering created by
our own selfish sense of what's fair.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:27.430
Now that you've lost your enemy,
you're facing yourself for the first time.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:31.100
And realizing you don't
know where you belong

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.690
Wh- what the hell?

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:39.690
Boss Yoh doesn't give up on guys
like us. He accepted me for who I was.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:41.900
He helped me see the light

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:43.570
Ryu...

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:48.070
After all, I can see ghosts now too.
That means I have enough talent!

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:51.120
I might even get to be popular someday!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.290
Good for you

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:57.380
It's good to have hope
while you're still alive.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.300
Don't talk as if you're giving up already

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.110
If you've got no place to
go, then I'll be your home.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:08.010
Once I become a Shaman, you
can become my guardian ghost.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.310
It's raining again

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:15.980
It's been a week now

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.310
I wonder how long this
will continue, father?

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:23.990
Why don't you take off your
mask inside the house, Mikihisa?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.650
It doesn't matter

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.820
I was talking about him, though.

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:34.450
Don't you think it's time to give in?

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.720
Morning already?

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.600
Wake up, Tokageroh

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:54.600
Where are we?!

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.600
The wilds of Okuizumo

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:04.110
The Hi'i river, the largest river in the
San-in district passes through this ravine.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:05.570
Pops!

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:09.450
I thought I might as well
test your tenacity of spirit.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.280
My tenacity?

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:16.870
You're going to fight me here?

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:20.540
I admit that you have some tenacity

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.920
But it's useless if it's half hearted

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:28.590
You're going to follow this
river without using roads.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:32.600
All the way to the summit of
Mt. Sentsuzan, the river's source.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:38.890
This sprite will ensure
that you don't cheat

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:45.110
If you reach the summit
successfully, I will train you.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.650
I will pray for your success

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:51.240
You rode my bike out here?!

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:55.240
The summit..?

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.750
Hey, sounds like fun, doesn't it?

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.230
Hey, how long are you
gonna sleep Tokageroh?

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.170
We've got a mountain to climb

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.800
You sent him to Sentsuzan?!

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:13.510
Please, take your mask
off when you're in the house.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:15.560
But what about him?

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:19.600
During the great flood, that
mountain killed a lot of people!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:23.650
That's the place where the legend
of Yamato no Orochi spawned!

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:27.190
That place is still wandering with ghosts.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:29.820
It's too dangerous for him

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:35.160
If he dies then he wasn't
meant to be a shaman.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:40.710
In truth, anyone can become a
shaman, it all depends on one's attitude.

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:45.420
One must first believe
in one's own abilities

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.800
Faith is the source of all power

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:54.140
Strong bodies and grand
ideas are born from it.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.600
If he fails...

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:02.770
It's because he didn't have enough faith

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:09.780
However strong a person is, he must
work hard to keep faith from flagging.

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:16.570
But in the world of Shamans, where
the strength of spirit is what matters...

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:20.700
An unwavering faith is everything.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:27.080
If he gets involved with the Asakura
family, he'll certainly encounter Hao.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:31.920
Will he have the tenacity to fight Hao?

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:36.800
We'll know when he finally
stands atop the mountain

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:41.970
At that moment he will gain true power

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.690
How beautiful!

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:53.660
This is the place where Ame no
murakumo no tsurugi appeared.

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:54.950
Pops

00:08:55.150 --> 00:09:01.200
Here, Susano'o descended and
slew Yamato no Orochi, the snake god.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:06.290
And from it's severed tail appeared
Ame no Murakumo no tsurugi

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.670
Orochi was a serpent
with 8 heads and 8 tails.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:14.340
They say it's length extended
over 8 hills and 8 valleys

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:19.220
Its eyes were red as cherries and
its stomach always stained with blood.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:21.510
That's awful!

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:24.310
Of course Orochi is a mythical creature

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:27.690
But not entirely fanciful

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:32.230
It came from this beautiful Hi'i river

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:38.280
The ancients believed that abundant
harvests were granted by the god of water...

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:41.620
And lived in the mountain
from which the river sprang

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:48.120
Sometimes there were torrential rains.
Floods swept away people and crops alike.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:53.830
Those people came to think of the river as the
violent Orochi that threatened their lives.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:10:00.480
Despite the difficulties, people protected
the land and built the beautiful Izumo.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.600
They challenged this mountain
just as you and never gave up.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:12.480
Like Susano'o who challenged Yamato no Orochi

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.110
Ready, Boris?!

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:17.650
Meet my new wooden
sword carved from God Wood!

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:21.950
This is my Ame no Murakumo
that slew Yamato no Orochi!

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.250
Blood...

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:30.620
My Over Soul blood isn't regenerating

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.250
Could I have exhausted my Furyoku...

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.470
You stupid fool

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:49.350
If you'd looked for your best place with me...

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:52.440
You wouldn't have to kill those people!

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:53.860
Ryu!

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:03.280
It's no wonder he expended a
huge amount of Furyoku all at once.

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:06.040
Lyserg!
Where's Blaumro?

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:08.200
He's long gone

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:11.830
I guess he had no regrets left

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.210
Sheesh, I feel lousy

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.710
Remorseless harming
other for his own benefit...

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.420
That's Hao's way

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:26.010
Huh, where are you going, Yoh?

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.390
I'm going to ask Boris about Hao

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:29.640
Huh?!

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:32.810
It's useless, he's Hao's minion!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.080
If we leave him alone, he may die

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:40.860
We'd just be a bunch of
common murderers then.

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.280
Yoh...

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.830
Yoh-sama...

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.300
What the hell is this?!

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:06.510
His name is Michael, the Archangel

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:12.520
He's my guardian ghost, he wields the
sword of punishment and condemns evil.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.400
Yoh-dono!

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:25.700
The evil one perished
when he faced our holy light.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:27.700
You're lucky

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:36.080
If we X-Laws hadn't arrived,
his sword would've slain you all.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.790
X-Laws...

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:55.310
Wh-who are they?

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.600
Why are they dressed like that...

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:02.940
Our organization is participating in
the Shaman Fight for a single purpose.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:09.910
We are here solely to defeat Hao,
the detestable ringleader of evil.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:12.660
You know Hao?!

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:17.120
Hao has appeared many
times throughout history.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.180
According to our research,
not only the patch tribe...

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:27.010
but 80% of Shamans participating in the
fight have some kind of connection with Hao

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:33.560
We came here because we
received a report from our friends.

00:13:34.850 --> 00:13:38.230
I'm Marco of the X-Laws,
Captain of Team Angel.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.490
We're on your side.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.270
Our side?

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.690
I never heard of you!

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:49.700
We X-Laws are a team of justice
seekers, dedicated to Hao's overthrow.

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:53.660
Anyone who interests Hao, interests us.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:55.660
They're powerful

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.870
You'd be no match
for them by yourselves.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:05.630
So for your own good,
you should continue with us.

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:10.680
We X-Laws come from all over the world...

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.790
We're victims of Hao
in one way or another.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.930
Dingbat, Minnie

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.940
Lucky, Bunstar

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:22.940
Pofe, Kevin

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:28.740
Some of us lost family and
loved ones because of him.

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:32.350
We each have our own
reasons, but our goal is the same.

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:36.620
Hao is an absolute evil that threatens
the law and order of this world.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:42.420
We will punish any of
his followers that we find.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:46.960
Are we actually gonna go with them, Yoh?

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:51.680
I don't know, I guess we're
all heading the same way.

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:54.310
Huh? What's on your mind?

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:56.430
Nothing, I'm fine

00:14:57.020 --> 00:15:00.810
Are you upset because they killed Boris?

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:04.980
What's the problem, Boris was a criminal.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:10.150
The world is full of
vicious and deadly people

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:16.950
People have no qualms about
harming others who are evil.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:21.420
There's nothing wrong
with executing a murderer.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:26.590
Boris worked for Hao,
who killed my parents.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:28.920
Lyserg…

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:31.900
I get where you're coming from, but...

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.350
They're splendid, don't you think?

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:36.760
You saw those Angels

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:38.810
Master

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:44.610
I've been a ghost for 500 years,
but I've never encountered their like.

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:49.540
It probably has something to do with
that Seirei-class, that guy spoke of.

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:56.030
I don't know if they're real,
but their power is impressive.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:03.000
And they're participants in the Shaman
fight, they'll be formidable opponents.

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:05.750
Hmm, I see

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:11.300
They must've overwhelmed
Boris by sheer numbers

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.340
You guys!

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:19.350
Did you think that joining forces with
these losers would help you through, X-Laws?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:22.640
What's funny?

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:25.000
Maybe we'll rip you into pieces here

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:27.730
Seems like one of you is missing

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:31.530
You wouldn't want to fight us without him

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:35.910
One of us is more than enough

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:39.410
Take this! Big Touchdown!

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:43.460
The former American
football player, Big Guy Bill.

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:48.170
His guardian ghosts are 21 of his
teammates who died in an accident.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:50.000
No problem

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:56.430
Servants of Hao deserve no mercy.

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.640
Deal death to evil

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:04.140
Archangels Fire!

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:19.450
We fire our angels
from these holy weapons

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:21.450
Gabriel

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:23.410
Raphael

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.160
Uriel

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.000
Metatron

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.040
Sariel

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.090
Remiel

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:36.220
These 7 Archangels
were given to us by god...

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:39.390
The closest class of spirits to God.

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:46.230
Brilliant, they're beautiful

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:53.330
You would have suffered
less if you hadn't resisted.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.280
Ah well, I'll end your suff-

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.220
Don't kill him

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:00.030
Maybe he deserves it...

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.530
But I don't like it

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.750
If you try to kill him...

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:10.460
I'll have to stop you

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:13.550
I don't understand

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.300
Why would you risk your live to save him?

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:22.010
Are you on Hao's side, too?

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:29.060
Wrong, I entered the Shaman Fight
because I wanted to live an easy live.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:31.360
I'm not on anybody's side

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:36.280
But wouldn't eliminating
evil, make life easier?

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:41.780
Evil strikes without warning
and ruin's people's lives.

00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:45.290
And those who
preserve peace are just.

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:50.870
A neutral person like you,
could never be Shaman King.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:55.340
So what? Right or wrong,
I'm going to stop you.

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:58.220
What's more evil than killing?

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.570
What did you say?

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:02.550
What is it?

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:07.850
Hey, this is getting nasty

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:11.310
Why would we stop them?

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:15.270
We'd better stop him

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:19.110
Yoh-kun doesn't stand a chance

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:22.530
I'm with Boss
Yoh, no matter what

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:26.490
I'll always back him
up, it's the least I can do.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.080
You're so lame, Ryu

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.620
Good luck, Boss!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.920
They have such contempt for Hao-sama!

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:35.340
Stop Zanchin, Do you want to die?

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.460
We better retreat for now

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:43.140
Are you seriously going to abandon Bill?!

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:46.310
There's a great power behind them

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:49.930
We've got to report this to Hao-sama

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:53.190
That is, if we can escape

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:55.980
Captain

00:19:57.020 --> 00:20:00.110
Kill them, justice is on our side

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:02.990
I won't let you kill him!

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:09.800
If you kill people for standing in
your way, you're no better than Hao!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.170
You fool!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.670
You dare to insult us?!

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:28.010
You knew you couldn't win, yet you challenged me

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:31.100
Was it a matter of honor for you?

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:38.190
You're very brave, so I'll spare your live.

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:41.150
The Patch Village is near here

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:43.900
If you want to live, go back

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:50.040
Your neutrality will be your ruin in
the world that lies beyond this spot.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:52.620
Boss...

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:00.130
What now? Harusame's broken.

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.250
So chill!

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:03.720
It's okay

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:06.130
At least no one got hurt

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:08.600
A sword can always be repaired

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:12.600
That was totally reckless
and irresponsible!

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.560
That's my boss!

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:17.900
Let's go

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:25.400
Wow!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:33.910
This is Mesa Verdede, now
we'll finally get to see Yoh-kun!

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:36.790
Where is he?

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:38.710
Not here...

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:45.880
This is a huge place

00:21:46.510 --> 00:21:51.810
According to Mikihisa-sama, there
should be a secret entrance around here.

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:55.640
That old man is  shiftless Vagabond

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:58.100
Can you really trust him?

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.100
If you want...

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:04.530
I can be your guide.

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.030
This area...

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:14.810
I know quite well.

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:50.920
Next time: "The Great Spirit & My Team"
